<div class="page-heading"><div class="section-overline">A LITTLE CLOSER TO YOURS</div><h1>Good find. Make it yours.</h1><p>Your seller will confirm the pickup. Payment happens at pickup.</p></div><div class="checkout-layout"><article class="surface checkout-summary"><img src="<%= product.image_path %>" alt="<%= product.title %>"><h2><%= product.title %></h2><p><%= product.seller_name %></p><strong class="large-price"><%= money(product.price) %></strong><p><%= product.stock %> available</p><p>Pickup: <%= product.pickup_location %></p></article><form action="/checkout/<%= product.id %>" method="post" class="surface" data-checkout data-unit-price="<%= product.price %>"><%- include('../partials/csrf') %><h2>A little plan for pickup</h2><label>Quantity<input type="number" name="quantity" value="1" min="1" max="<%= Math.min(product.stock,1000) %>" required></label><label>Pickup details<textarea name="pickup_details" minlength="5" maxlength="300" rows="4" placeholder="Suggest a day and time. Confirm the meeting point with your seller." required></textarea></label><div class="order-total"><span>Order total</span><output data-order-total><%= money(product.price) %></output></div><p class="quiet-note">Check the item at pickup. Your order reserves this quantity while your seller confirms it.</p><button class="primary-button full-width" type="submit">Place my pickup order ↗</button></form></div>
